  {
   "id": "will-follow-the-light-314421@post-2026-06-20",
   "gameId": "will-follow-the-light-314421",
   "displayName": "Patch Note #5 is Now LIVE 💡",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-20T16:00:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Come in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new update for WILL: Follow The Light is now live, bringing another round of improvements and fixes from the crew.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, thank you for your comments – we read every single one of them! Many of the changes in this update come directly from things you've pointed out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "This update includes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• Removed unnecessary interactions in Chapter 1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Added an extra hint for the beer tap puzzle in Chapter 2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed inspection issues with several objects in Chapter 2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Reworked the lamp assembly puzzle in Chapter 3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed route visualization on the map in Chapter 3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Simplified the lens sequence in Chapter 6",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Simplified the safe puzzle in Chapter 7",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Improved several secondary NPC animations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Removed page-turning sounds while reading notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Simplified the winch assembly puzzle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed various collision issues across multiple locations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Cosmetic visual improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Cosmetic updates to the game menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're continuing to refine the journey, and we have even more improvements planned for the months ahead. Check our roadmap to see what's coming next!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fair winds! Over and out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45157952/68628e397454915af2871f7ef60bb2aeddb34a97.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
