  {
   "id": "will-follow-the-light-314421@post-2026-06-06",
   "gameId": "will-follow-the-light-314421",
   "displayName": "Patch Note 4 is Now LIVE ⚓️",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-06T21:25:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Come in, this is Tomorrowhead Studio.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our crew has been hard at work behind the scenes, and today we're releasing another update for WILL: Follow The Light.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, thank you for all the feedback you've been sending our way. We continue reading everything carefully and making adjustments wherever we can to improve the game experience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Today's update includes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• General UI improvements;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Added an option to disable subtitles;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed gamepad stick drift;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Adjusted the render distance of certain characters;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed collision issues in Chapters 2, 5, and 6;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed a bug causing background fog to disappear in Chapter 4.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Whether you're playing on Steam or Steam Deck, we hope these improvements make the voyage a little smoother.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "And we're not dropping anchor just yet. More improvements, fixes, and updates are already being charted for future patches.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Over and out, and thank you for staying with us on this journey.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
