  {
   "id": "will-follow-the-light-314421@major-2026-05-16",
   "gameId": "will-follow-the-light-314421",
   "displayName": "Patch Note 3 – Major Update is Now LIVE",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-05-16T16:12:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Come in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is TomorrowHead Studio Team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Over the past days, we’ve been carefully reading all your feedback. A huge amount of your thoughts and suggestions directly shaped the update we’re releasing today. Thank you for your input!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It honestly means a lot to see how many people care enough to share detailed feedback with us. We know WILL: Follow The Light still has areas that can be improved, and we’re doing our best every day to make the experience smoother, clearer, and stronger while keeping the atmosphere and vision of the game intact.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Today, we’re releasing our first Major Update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• A completed chapter selector has been added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Cloud saves have been added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Improved UI for Steam Deck and increased text size",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "• The puzzles in Chapter 2 have been reworked",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• The puzzles in Chapter 5 have been reworked",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• The puzzles in Chapter 6 have been reworked",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Additional checkpoints have been added to Chapters 5 and 6",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• A Load Game option has been added to the pause menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And we’re not stopping here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re already continuing work on future improvements, including additional localization fixes and refinements. Thank you again for playing WILL, supporting the project, and helping us improve it with every update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Over and out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
