  {
   "id": "will-follow-the-light-314421@post-2026-05-08",
   "gameId": "will-follow-the-light-314421",
   "displayName": "Patch Note 1 – First Repairs",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-05-08T15:36:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Come in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is TomorrowHead Studio Team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, thank you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And of course, like with any launch, some bugs managed to sneak aboard Molly. Thanks to your reports, feedback, screenshots, videos, and patience, we’ve already managed to track down and fix a number of issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here’s our very first patch notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• Fixed an issue where the lantern/journal could not be taken out in Mistvik",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed an issue with departing from the dock on the Bird Island",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed automatic language detection",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed an issue where the boat could flip over in the fog",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed a popup window appearing during route planning on the map",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed several texture-related issues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ll continue actively monitoring feedback and improving the game. Thank you for staying the course with us, and we hope your journey will now be even smoother.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Over and out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45157952/0da8b3e4192a125296958df1cfdeb1e1cef8d496.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
